# The grey box (game/corridor.h's boxes, game/walker.h's heights), booted on foot in the corridor:
# up the corridor holding Up all the way: it builds to a run, vaults the crate, climbs the stairs
# onto the platform (160) and jumps off its end onto the lower roof (64), and on to the tower
# beyond it, a wall (run_vault.steps films that closely). A shot a second. Then off the lower roof's side
# (L: facing west, that's towards the corridor's middle), 64 down to the floor.
# Film it with tests\e2e\run_e2e.ps1 -Steps greybox.steps (built with BOOT_ON_FOOT 1)
wait_up # booted on foot in the corridor (BOOT_ON_FOOT): no ride there
shot gb_00_stood
keydown up
wait 1
